{"title":"Career roadmap · Clinical Research Coordinator","role":"Clinical Research Coordinator","summary":"A Clinical Research Coordinator (CRC) manages the day-to-day operational activities of clinical research studies at a hospital, research institution, clinical research organisation (CRO) or pharmaceutical/biotechnology company.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Life Sciences / Biological Sciences"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A CRC typically coordinates:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Protocol","Site Setup","Participant Recruitment","Informed Consent","Study Visits","Data Collection","Investigational Product Accountability","Safety Reporting","Monitoring","Close-out"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is a directly relevant career for Life Sciences / Biological Sciences graduates, although some employers prefer or require additional clinical-research training and relevant experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Career-route check"},{"type":"note","label":"Starts","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"note","label":"Current degree","text":"B.Sc. Life Sciences / Biological Sciences"},{"type":"note","label":"Desired career","text":"Clinical Research Coordinator"},{"type":"flow","items":["Life Sciences","Clinical Research","Clinical Operations"],"label":"Career cluster"},{"type":"note","label":"Entry accessibility","text":"Direct/near-direct"},{"type":"note","label":"Typical entry titles","text":"Clinical Research Coordinator, Clinical Research Assistant, Clinical Trial Assistant, Clinical Data Coordinator, Research Coordinator, Clinical Research Associate Trainee"},{"type":"note","label":"Assumption","text":"three/four-year B.Sc. structure depending on the university, beginning in 2026."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build biology, human physiology, pharmacology, research methodology, biostatistics, ethics and clinical-trial fundamentals."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Enter clinical research as CRC/Clinical Research Assistant and develop site-management, documentation and regulatory skills."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior CRC, Clinical Research Associate, Clinical Trial Manager or specialised clinical-operations roles."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward Clinical Operations Manager, Project Manager, Study Lead, Clinical Research Management or specialised trial leadership."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Cell biology, genetics, biochemistry and human biology"},{"text":"NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"Biology research summary"},{"text":"Life-science foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Human anatomy, physiology and microbiology"},{"text":"University laboratory + NPTEL"},{"text":"Clinical-science notes"},{"text":"Clinical foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Pharmacology basics, pathology and disease mechanisms"},{"text":"NPTEL + textbooks"},{"text":"Disease/drug mechanism project"},{"text":"Medical knowledge"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Research methodology and biostatistics"},{"text":"NPTEL"},{"text":"Clinical-data analysis project"},{"text":"Research capability"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Clinical trials, ethics, informed consent and GCP"},{"text":"ICH","url":"https://www.ich.org/"},{"text":"Mock clinical-trial protocol"},{"text":"Clinical research readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Clinical documentation, safety reporting and regulatory concepts"},{"text":"ICH + WHO/FDA resources"},{"text":"Trial-documentation portfolio"},{"text":"Operational capability"}],[{"text":"Final Year / Sem 1"},{"text":"Clinical research interns